# Dockerization

- Use latest versions of every software/component
- Use multi-stage building
- Docker containers as small as possible
- Keep it simple
- Respect the correct filepaths of the apps and keep in mind that client and server will be in different containers when creating filepaths related to docker
- do not repeat as environment variables in the docker-cpomse what is already in a .env file
